{"title":"Emergent Ventures UK Tranche","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920221619/0/marginalrevolution~Emergent-Ventures-UK-Tranche.html","date":1749917730000,"content":"<p><span>I’m pleased to announce a new tranche of Emergent Ventures, focused specifically on progress-oriented projects in the United Kingdom. This initiative is made possible in partnership with <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://secure-web.cisco.com/13i9sD0v3u7v57fmWQjQ7i-mULuDQ9BFbsgXJsAjrLg2dQJ-VggpHQSHsDAX3OZrwcauc1GGbvK8EvfitqtFuwULQIifSZmXHD5KUL8V5b__vm1L92yzaMpo_Pqq5XORkmwJ2xn7q5bpEPVg4v9Mk-_VnsKhwjNWuyUg1rgL3XA--2yEG4g6wBJLX17tc73ZJpXqdU88UPQX5gT6YnEFIIaTChRWkWZzFH4tR9jb_hkfbRQx2J0evny1wClDZW5iGN1ukNAZ47g5wezKnjPfzP7uJx-7J41IcChEiCtiVSVW0wVQ0TZNg-vSVRd8MSriS298F3dEpk9lamJW3gOzrlXn3MeU1GC-1mHfwcfjuW45icyV4QqO0GzX0aboHPiIYzvBSAuBpIBPVGUHpdrMDLt94Aj6oV7GEch2Ki_AteEE/https%3A%2F%2Fwww.founderspledge.com%2F\" target=\"_blank\">Founders Pledge</a> and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://secure-web.cisco.com/1wyKeMcbdl3t20r2ml2tIRYPbZeISkSASFb_yMjYdy_F1xc8pMTOaPUZJdlFVSQ8LVNe_BfvS5Hm10kMvTbrcFJXiMbDx8aStXVCsSbbTMcywEv-MsHL9SgQ5kMGknmvGV2dV3vphj-X0IDmLVGPlf_jhgvDHjsrGiRWLhpsz962yzvvqR0wO96Fk74wiHB2KfgWf0RuR1Gn_rrUpRmED2BgGK6Z8OQt5sI-IZtE-3XczI9WgQ_85HoEPd7tMQQr3aTve3GNm79uvzyJ17YHmuvwAhbewfF1A1a-R8Xggoz5xFUegmp2zRzBaMoP9KLicpddC73CeHhUjOQR5ie3_3UUPbySNCdK-LFMEpgYc_xVVocili1N4ZE6zJuo_0CudPmmXB2Bq3k7P4Q_oXaVG37MB9R1Z5D1tRoPTcyweLg4/https%3A%2F%2Frenaissancephilanthropy.org%2F\" target=\"_blank\">Renaissance Philanthropy</a>.</span></p>\r\n<p>While EV has regarded the UK as a priority area from the beginning, this tranche enables increased support for pro-science, pro-progress projects at a critical time. Those interested can <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mercatus.org%2Femergent-ventures&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C3d4a39fbf6324ac84cb408ddaa88f32a%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638854227354061539%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=6hhu7K9g%2BjAEOGCzcdhIDCfOoZFGanp0bXmPgT8rJFk%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">apply</a> through the standard Emergent Ventures application process, selecting “United Kingdom” in the dropdown for “My project will affect.”</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/emergent-ventures-uk-tranche.html\">Emergent Ventures UK Tranche</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920221619/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920221619/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920221619/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/920221619/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/920221619/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/920221619/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/emergent-ventures-uk-tranche.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/emergent-ventures-uk-tranche.html/feed\